          <span class="yt-small" data-ff-copied aria-live="polite"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:1.6rem">
        <div class="yt-h3">Aynı kare, dört kırpma</div>
        <div class="yt-tpls" data-minis style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(140px,1fr))"></div>
        <p class="yt-small">Küçük önizlemeler seçtiğiniz kadrajın merkezini korur. Tıklayınca o orana geçersiniz.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="at-steps" aria-label="Nasıl kullanılır">
        <li><strong>Dosyanızı açın.</strong> JPG, PNG, WebP görsel ya da MP4, MOV, WebM video. Dosya seçmezseniz örnek bir 16:9 kare gösterilir.</li>
        <li><strong>Oranı seçin, kadrajı sürükleyin.</strong> Parlak alan kalan kısımdır. Yakınlaştırma ile daha sıkı kırpın; bilgisayarda ok tuşları da çalışır.</li>
        <li><strong>Kontrol edin, indirin.</strong> Çözünürlük uyarısına bakın; kırpılmış kareyi, kırpma çerçevesini ya da FFmpeg satırını alın.</li>
      </ol>
    </Section>

    <Section width="default" space="tight" id="olculer">
      <SectionHeading eyebrow="Ölçüler">16:9 kayıttan hangi oran ne kadar kalır?</SectionHeading>
      <div class="yt-tablewrap">
        <table class="yt-table">
          <caption>Ortadan kırpmada kalan alan (matematiksel, yuvarlama 1 px)</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Hedef</th><th scope="col">1920×1080'den</th><th scope="col">3840×2160'tan</th><th scope="col">Kalan alan</th><th scope="col">Nerede?</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {
              TABLE.map((r) => (
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row">{r.label}</th>
                  <td>{r.c.w}×{r.c.h}</td>
                  <td>{r.c4k.w}×{r.c4k.h}</td>
                  <td>%{r.keep}</td>
                  <td>{r.use}</td>
                </tr>
              ))
            }
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <ul class="yt-tips">
        <li><strong>Çift yayın planlıyorsanız 4K çekin.</strong> 4K'dan alınan 9:16 şerit (1215×2160) 1080×1920 teslim için yeterli; 1080p'den alınan şerit büyütülmek zorunda.</li>
        <li><strong>Konuyu merkeze yakın tutun.</strong> 9:16'da 16:9 karenin yalnızca orta üçte biri kalır; iki kişilik röportajda kişilerden biri dışarıda kalır.</li>
        <li><strong>Yazıyı sonradan ekleyin.</strong> Yatay kurguya gömülü başlıklar kırpmada kesilir; dikey versiyonda metni ayrıca yerleştirin ve <a href="/araclar/guvenli-alan/">güvenli alan kontrolü</a> ile arayüz altında kalmadığını görün.</li>
        <li><strong>Teslim ayarları:</strong> dikey video için 1080×1920, akış için 1080×1350. Codec ve bitrate için <a href="/rehber/video-export-ayarlari/">video export ayarları rehberine</a> bakın.</li>
      </ul>
    </Section>

    <Section width="wide" space="tight" id="sablonlar">
      <SectionHeading eyebrow="İndir · CC BY 4.0">
        Şeffaf kırpma maskeleri (16:9, 1920×1080)
        <Fragment slot="intro">
          <p class="yt-prose">
            Kurgu programınızda 16:9 zaman çizelgesinin en üst katmanına koyun; koyu alan kırpmada kaybolur. 4K projede %200
            ölçekleyin. <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.tr" rel="license noopener" target="_blank">CC BY 4.0</a>:
            ticari işlerde de kullanabilirsiniz, tek şart atıf (“Rast Creative Studio — rastcreative.com”).
          </p>
        </Fragment>
      </SectionHeading>
      <ul class="yt-tpls" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr))">
        {
          templates.map((t) => (
            <li>
              <a href={TPL + t.file} download>
                <img src={TPL + t.file} alt={`${t.label} şeffaf kırpma maskesi önizlemesi`} width="192" height="108" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                <span>{t.label}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p><a class="ev-btn ev-btn--sun" href={TPL + "rast-kirpma-cerceveleri.zip"} download>Tüm maskeler (ZIP)</a></p>
    </Section>

    <Extras
      faqs={faqs}
      pageUrl={PAGE_URL}
      linkText="En-boy oranı ve kırpma önizleme"
      attribution="Kırpma maskesi: Rast Creative Studio — rastcreative.com"
      current={PATH}
      ctaTitle="Tek çekimden yatay ve dikey video"
    >
      <Fragment slot="sources">
        <p>Kırpma ölçüleri matematiksel hesaptır (yaklaşık değil). Platform oranları şu kaynaklardan:</p>
        <ul class="yt-sources">
          <li>Instagram Yardım Merkezi, “Reel size & aspect ratios on Instagram”: Reels 1,91:1 ile 9:16 arasında yüklenebilir, en düşük 720 px (erişim 30.10.2026). <a href="https://help.instagram.com/1038071743007909" rel="noopener" target="_blank">help.instagram.com</a></li>
          <li>Meta Ads Guide, Instagram akış ve Reels reklam ölçüleri: akışta 1:1 ve 4:5, Reels/Story'de 9:16 (erişim 30.10.2026). <a href="https://www.facebook.com/business/ads-guide" rel="noopener" target="_blank">facebook.com/business/ads-guide</a></li>
          <li>Instagram profil ızgarasının 1:1'den 3:4'e geçişi: Adam Mosseri'nin Ocak 2025 duyurusu, haberi: Gadgets360 (erişim 30.10.2026). <a href="https://www.gadgets360.com/apps/news/instagram-update-profile-grid-reels-duration-three-minute-7517402" rel="noopener" target="_blank">gadgets360.com</a></li>
          <li>YouTube Yardım, “Add video thumbnails”: videolar için 16:9 önerisi (erişim 30.10.2026). <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/72431?hl=tr" rel="noopener" target="_blank">support.google.com</a></li>
          <li>FFmpeg Filters Documentation, crop ve scale filtreleri. <a href="https://ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg-filters.html#crop" rel="noopener" target="_blank">ffmpeg.org</a></li>
        </ul>
      </Fragment>
      <Fragment slot="cta">
        Rast Creative Studio, çekimi baştan çoklu format için planlar: yatay film, dikey Reels ve akış kesimleri aynı çekim
        gününden çıkar. Düzenli içerik için <a href="/sosyal-medya-icerigi/">sosyal medya içeriği</a>, tek seferlik işler için
        <a href="/video-cekimi/">video çekimi</a> ve <a href="/tanitim-filmi/">tanıtım filmi</a> sayfalarına bakabilirsiniz.
      </Fragment>
    </Extras>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { exportCanvasPng, drawCredit, loadLogo, wireDrop, isVideoFile, isImageFile, fmtTime, canvasPoint, pngWithMeta, downloadBlob } from "./_yaratici/client";

  const PAGE = "https://rastcreative.com/araclar/en-boy-orani/";
  const PATH = "/araclar/en-boy-orani/";
  const RATIOS: Record<string, { w: number; h: number; label: string; use: string; out: [number, number] }> = {
    "9x16": { w: 9, h: 16, label: "9:16", use: "Reels, TikTok, Shorts, Story · teslim 1080×1920", out: [1080, 1920] },
    "4x5": { w: 4, h: 5, label: "4:5", use: "Instagram/Facebook akış · teslim 1080×1350", out: [1080, 1350] },
    "3x4": { w: 3, h: 4, label: "3:4", use: "Instagram profil ızgarası / 3:4 gönderi · teslim 1080×1440", out: [1080, 1440] },
    "1x1": { w: 1, h: 1, label: "1:1", use: "Kare gönderi · teslim 1080×1080", out: [1080, 1080] },
    "16x9": { w: 16, h: 9, label: "16:9", use: "YouTube, web, TV · teslim 1920×1080", out: [1920, 1080] },
    "4x3": { w: 4, h: 3, label: "4:3", use: "4:3 ekranlar · teslim 1440×1080", out: [1440, 1080] },
  };
  const MINI = ["9x16", "4x5", "3x4", "1x1"];

  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-tool]");
  if (root) init(root);

  function init(root: HTMLElement) {
    const $ = <T extends Element>(s: string) => root.querySelector<T>(s)!;
    const canvas = $<HTMLCanvasElement>("[data-canvas]");
    const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d")!;
    const out = $<HTMLCanvasElement>("[data-out]");
    const octx = out.getContext("2d")!;
    const warn = $<HTMLElement>("[data-warn]");
    const info = $<HTMLElement>("[data-info]");
    const useEl = $<HTMLElement>("[data-use]");
    const zoom = $<HTMLInputElement>("[data-zoom]");
    const zoomV = $<HTMLElement>("[data-zoomv]");
    const thirds = $<HTMLInputElement>("[data-thirds]");
    const custom = $<HTMLElement>("[data-custom]");
    const cw = $<HTMLInputElement>("[data-cw]");
    const ch = $<HTMLInputElement>("[data-ch]");
    const ff = $<HTMLElement>("[data-ffmpeg]");
    const player = $<HTMLElement>("[data-player]");
    const playBtn = $<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-play]");
    const seek = $<HTMLInputElement>("[data-seek]");
    const timeEl = $<HTMLElement>("[data-time]");
    const clearBtn = $<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-clear]");
    const minis = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-minis]")!;
    const logo = loadLogo();

    // synthetic 16:9 sample so the tool shows something useful before upload
    const sample = document.createElement("canvas");
    sample.width = 1920;
    sample.height = 1080;
    paintSample(sample.getContext("2d")!);

    const st = {
      media: sample as CanvasImageSource,
      sw: 1920,
      sh: 1080,
      name: "ornek",
      ratio: "9x16",
      cx: 0.5, // crop centre (0..1 of source)
      cy: 0.5,
      zoom: 1,
      url: "",
      video: null as HTMLVideoElement | null,
    };

    function ratio() {
      if (st.ratio === "custom") {
        const w = Math.max(0.01, Number(cw.value) || 1);
        const h = Math.max(0.01, Number(ch.value) || 1);
        return { w, h, label: `${w}:${h}`, use: "Özel oran", out: [0, 0] as [number, number] };
      }
      return RATIOS[st.ratio];
    }

    function cropFor(r: { w: number; h: number }, cx = st.cx, cy = st.cy, z = st.zoom) {
      let w = st.sh * (r.w / r.h);
      let h = st.sh;
      if (w > st.sw) {
        w = st.sw;
        h = st.sw * (r.h / r.w);
      }
      w /= z;
      h /= z;
      let x = cx * st.sw - w / 2;
      let y = cy * st.sh - h / 2;
      x = Math.min(Math.max(0, x), st.sw - w);
      y = Math.min(Math.max(0, y), st.sh - h);
      return { x: Math.round(x), y: Math.round(y), w: Math.round(w), h: Math.round(h) };
    }

    function sizeCanvas() {
      const maxW = 1600;
      const k = Math.min(1, maxW / st.sw, 1600 / st.sh);
      canvas.width = Math.round(st.sw * k);
      canvas.height = Math.round(st.sh * k);
    }

    function draw() {
      const r = ratio();
      const c = cropFor(r);
      const k = canvas.width / st.sw;
      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
      ctx.drawImage(st.media, 0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
      // dim outside
      ctx.fillStyle = "rgba(12,12,16,.62)";
      const X = c.x * k, Y = c.y * k, Wc = c.w * k, Hc = c.h * k;
      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, Y);
      ctx.fillRect(0, Y + Hc, canvas.width, canvas.height - Y - Hc);
      ctx.fillRect(0, Y, X, Hc);
      ctx.fillRect(X + Wc, Y, canvas.width - X - Wc, Hc);
      ctx.strokeStyle = "#3ddc84";
      ctx.lineWidth = Math.max(2, canvas.width / 400);
      ctx.strokeRect(X, Y, Wc, Hc);
      if (thirds.checked) {
        ctx.strokeStyle = "rgba(255,255,255,.45)";
        ctx.lineWidth = 1;
        for (const i of [1, 2]) {
          line(X + (Wc * i) / 3, Y, X + (Wc * i) / 3, Y + Hc);
          line(X, Y + (Hc * i) / 3, X + Wc, Y + (Hc * i) / 3);
        }
      }
      const fs = Math.max(14, canvas.width / 60);
      ctx.font = `700 ${fs}px system-ui, sans-serif`;
      const lbl = `${r.label} · ${c.w}×${c.h} px`;
      const tw = ctx.measureText(lbl).width;
      ctx.fillStyle = "rgba(12,12,16,.75)";
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.roundRect(X + 8, Y + 8, tw + fs, fs * 1.8, fs * 0.9);
      ctx.fill();
      ctx.fillStyle = "#3ddc84";
      ctx.fillText(lbl, X + 8 + fs / 2, Y + 8 + fs * 1.25);

      // output preview
      const ow = 540;
      const oh = Math.round(ow * (c.h / c.w));
      if (oh > 960) {
        out.height = 960;
        out.width = Math.round(960 * (c.w / c.h));
      } else {
        out.width = ow;
        out.height = oh;
      }
      octx.drawImage(st.media, c.x, c.y, c.w, c.h, 0, 0, out.width, out.height);

      // info + warnings
      const o = r.out;
      useEl.textContent = r.use;
      let msg = `Kırpma: x ${c.x}, y ${c.y}, ${c.w}×${c.h} px (kaynak ${st.sw}×${st.sh}). Kalan alan %${Math.round(((c.w * c.h) / (st.sw * st.sh)) * 100)}.`;
      if (o[0]) {
        const up = o[0] / c.w;
        msg += ` Teslim ${o[0]}×${o[1]} için ölçek ×${up.toFixed(2).replace(".", ",")}.`;
        if (up > 1.05) {
          warn.textContent = `Kırpılan alan ${c.w}×${c.h} px; ${o[0]}×${o[1]} teslim için yaklaşık ${up.toFixed(1).replace(".", ",")} kat büyütülmesi gerekiyor, görüntü yumuşar. Dikey ve yatay birlikte yayınlanacaksa 4K çekin ya da daha geniş bir kadraj seçin.`;
          warn.hidden = false;
        } else warn.hidden = true;
      } else warn.hidden = true;
      info.textContent = msg;
      const outName = st.name === "ornek" ? "girdi" : st.name.replace(/\.[^.]+$/, "") || "girdi";
      const scale = o[0] ? `,scale=${o[0]}:${o[1]}` : "";
      const ext = st.video ? "mp4" : "png";
      ff.textContent = st.video
        ? `ffmpeg -i "${st.name}" -vf "crop=${c.w}:${c.h}:${c.x}:${c.y}${scale}" -c:a copy "${outName}-${r.label.replace(":", "x")}.${ext}"`
        : `ffmpeg -i "${st.name === "ornek" ? "girdi.jpg" : st.name}" -vf "crop=${c.w}:${c.h}:${c.x}:${c.y}${scale}" "${outName}-${r.label.replace(":", "x")}.${ext}"`;
      drawMinis();
    }

    function line(a: number, b: number, c: number, d: number) {
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.moveTo(a, b);
      ctx.lineTo(c, d);
      ctx.stroke();
    }

    // mini previews of 4 ratios
    const miniEls: Record<string, HTMLCanvasElement> = {};
    for (const id of MINI) {
      const r = RATIOS[id];
      const a = document.createElement("button");
      a.type = "button";
      a.className = "yt-btn";
      a.style.cssText = "display:grid;gap:.4rem;justify-items:center;padding:.6rem;border-radius:.9rem;height:auto";
      const cv = document.createElement("canvas");
      cv.width = 120;
      cv.height = Math.round((120 * r.h) / r.w);
      cv.style.cssText = `width:${Math.round((140 * r.w) / Math.max(r.w, r.h * 0.75))}px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:.4rem;background:#0e0e10`;
      cv.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
      const sp = document.createElement("span");
      sp.textContent = `${r.label}`;
      a.append(cv, sp);
      a.setAttribute("aria-label", `${r.label} oranına geç`);
      a.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const radio = root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="ratio"][value="${id}"]`);
        if (radio) {
          radio.checked = true;
          radio.dispatchEvent(new Event("change"));
        }
      });
      const li = document.createElement("div");
      li.append(a);
      minis.append(li);
      miniEls[id] = cv;
    }
    function drawMinis() {
      for (const id of MINI) {
        const cv = miniEls[id];
        const c = cropFor(RATIOS[id], st.cx, st.cy, 1);
        cv.getContext("2d")!.drawImage(st.media, c.x, c.y, c.w, c.h, 0, 0, cv.width, cv.height);
      }
    }

    // ---------- interaction
    let drag: { dx: number; dy: number } | null = null;
    canvas.addEventListener("pointerdown", (ev) => {
      const p = canvasPoint(canvas, ev);
      const k = canvas.width / st.sw;
      const c = cropFor(ratio());
      const sx = p.x / k, sy = p.y / k;
      // grab anywhere: inside → drag offset, outside → jump centre there
      if (!(sx >= c.x && sx <= c.x + c.w && sy >= c.y && sy <= c.y + c.h)) {
        st.cx = sx / st.sw;
        st.cy = sy / st.sh;
        normalise();
      }
      const c2 = cropFor(ratio());
      drag = { dx: sx - (c2.x + c2.w / 2), dy: sy - (c2.y + c2.h / 2) };
      canvas.setPointerCapture(ev.pointerId);
      draw();
    });
    canvas.addEventListener("pointermove", (ev) => {
      if (!drag) return;
      const p = canvasPoint(canvas, ev);
      const k = canvas.width / st.sw;
      st.cx = (p.x / k - drag.dx) / st.sw;
      st.cy = (p.y / k - drag.dy) / st.sh;
      normalise();
      draw();
    });
    const end = () => (drag = null);
    canvas.addEventListener("pointerup", end);
    canvas.addEventListener("pointercancel", end);
    canvas.addEventListener("keydown", (ev) => {
      const step = ev.shiftKey ? 0.05 : 0.01;
      if (ev.key === "ArrowLeft") st.cx -= step;
      else if (ev.key === "ArrowRight") st.cx += step;
      else if (ev.key === "ArrowUp") st.cy -= step;
      else if (ev.key === "ArrowDown") st.cy += step;
      else return;
      ev.preventDefault();
      normalise();
      draw();
    });
    // keep centre consistent with clamped crop so the next drag doesn't jump
    function normalise() {
      const c = cropFor(ratio());
      st.cx = (c.x + c.w / 2) / st.sw;
      st.cy = (c.y + c.h / 2) / st.sh;
    }

    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="ratio"]').forEach((r) =>
      r.addEventListener("change", () => {
        st.ratio = r.value;
        custom.hidden = r.value !== "custom";
        normalise();
        draw();
      }),
    );
    [cw, ch].forEach((i) => i.addEventListener("input", () => draw()));
    zoom.addEventListener("input", () => {
      st.zoom = Number(zoom.value) / 100;
      zoomV.textContent = `%${zoom.value}`;
      normalise();
      draw();
    });
    thirds.addEventListener("change", draw);
    $<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-center]").addEventListener("click", () => {
      st.cx = 0.5;
      st.cy = 0.5;
      draw();
    });

    // ---------- media
    let raf = 0;
    function loop() {
      draw();
      const v = st.video;
      if (v) {
        seek.value = String(v.currentTime);
        timeEl.textContent = `${fmtTime(v.currentTime)} / ${fmtTime(v.duration || 0)}`;
        if (!v.paused && !v.ended) raf = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
      }
    }
    function reset() {
      cancelAnimationFrame(raf);
      st.video?.pause();
      if (st.url) URL.revokeObjectURL(st.url);
      Object.assign(st, { media: sample, sw: 1920, sh: 1080, name: "ornek", url: "", video: null, cx: 0.5, cy: 0.5 });
      player.hidden = true;
      clearBtn.hidden = true;
      sizeCanvas();
      draw();
    }
    function load(f: File) {
      if (!isVideoFile(f) && !isImageFile(f)) {
        warn.textContent = "Bu dosya türü desteklenmiyor. JPG, PNG, WebP, MP4, MOV ya da WebM seçin.";
        warn.hidden = false;
        return;
      }
      reset();
      st.url = URL.createObjectURL(f);
      st.name = f.name;
      if (isVideoFile(f)) {
        const v = document.createElement("video");
        v.muted = true;
        v.playsInline = true;
        v.preload = "auto";
        v.src = st.url;
        v.addEventListener("loadeddata", () => {
          Object.assign(st, { media: v, video: v, sw: v.videoWidth, sh: v.videoHeight });
          seek.max = String(v.duration || 0);
          player.hidden = false;
          clearBtn.hidden = false;
          sizeCanvas();
          loop();
        });
        v.addEventListener("seeked", loop);
        v.addEventListener("play", () => {
          playBtn.textContent = "Durdur";
          loop();
        });
        v.addEventListener("pause", () => (playBtn.textContent = "Oynat"));
        v.addEventListener("error", () => {
          warn.textContent = "Video açılamadı. Tarayıcınız bu codec'i desteklemiyor olabilir (ör. bazı HEVC .mov dosyaları); MP4 (H.264) deneyin.";
          warn.hidden = false;
        });
      } else {
        const img = new Image();
        img.onload = () => {
          Object.assign(st, { media: img, sw: img.naturalWidth, sh: img.naturalHeight });
          clearBtn.hidden = false;
          sizeCanvas();
          draw();
        };
        img.src = st.url;
      }
    }
    wireDrop($<HTMLElement>("[data-drop]"), $<HTMLInputElement>("[data-file]"), (fs) => load(fs[0]));
    clearBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      $<HTMLInputElement>("[data-file]").value = "";
      reset();
    });
    playBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const v = st.video;
      if (v) v.paused ? v.play() : v.pause();
    });
    seek.addEventListener("input", () => {
      if (st.video) st.video.currentTime = Number(seek.value);
    });

    // ---------- downloads
    const base = () => (st.name === "ornek" ? "ornek" : st.name.replace(/\.[^.]+$/, "").replace(/[^\w-]+/g, "-").slice(0, 40));
    $<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-dl-crop]").addEventListener("click", () => {
      const r = ratio();
      const c = cropFor(r);
      const cv = document.createElement("canvas");
      cv.width = c.w;
      cv.height = c.h;
      cv.getContext("2d")!.drawImage(st.media, c.x, c.y, c.w, c.h, 0, 0, c.w, c.h);
      exportCanvasPng(cv, `rast-kirpma-${base()}-${r.label.replace(":", "x")}-${c.w}x${c.h}.png`, PAGE, "Rast Creative aspect ratio crop tool", "Your own image; tool by Rast Creative Studio");
    });
    $<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-dl-frame]").addEventListener("click", () => {
      const r = ratio();
      const c = cropFor(r);
      const cv = document.createElement("canvas");
      cv.width = st.sw;
      cv.height = st.sh;
      const g = cv.getContext("2d")!;
      g.fillStyle = "rgba(12,12,16,.6)";
      g.fillRect(0, 0, st.sw, st.sh);
      g.clearRect(c.x, c.y, c.w, c.h);
      g.strokeStyle = "#3ddc84";
      g.lineWidth = Math.max(3, st.sw / 400);
      g.strokeRect(c.x, c.y, c.w, c.h);
      const s = st.sw / 1920;
      g.fillStyle = "#fff";
      g.font = `700 ${Math.round(30 * s)}px system-ui, sans-serif`;
      // label + credit in the dark (cropped-away) area when there is room
      const side = c.x > st.sw - c.x - c.w ? "left" : "right";
      const roomX = side === "left" ? c.x : st.sw - c.x - c.w;
      const roomY = Math.max(c.y, st.sh - c.y - c.h);
      if (roomX > 260 * s) {
        const x0 = side === "left" ? 30 * s : c.x + c.w + 30 * s;
        g.fillText(`${r.label} · ${c.w}×${c.h}`, x0, 60 * s);
        g.font = `500 ${Math.round(22 * s)}px system-ui, sans-serif`;
        g.fillText(`x ${c.x}, y ${c.y}`, x0, 96 * s);
        drawCredit(g, logo, x0, st.sh - 70 * s, s * 0.9, PATH);
      } else if (roomY > 90 * s) {
        const y0 = c.y > st.sh - c.y - c.h ? 20 * s : c.y + c.h + 20 * s;
        g.fillText(`${r.label} · ${c.w}×${c.h}`, 30 * s, y0 + 34 * s);
        drawCredit(g, logo, st.sw - 30 * s, y0, s * 0.9, PATH, "right");
      }
      exportCanvasPng(cv, `rast-kirpma-cercevesi-${r.label.replace(":", "x")}-${st.sw}x${st.sh}.png`, PAGE, "Rast Creative aspect ratio crop tool", "CC BY 4.0 - Rast Creative Studio - rastcreative.com");
    });
    $<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-copy-ff]").addEventListener("click", async () => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(ff.textContent || "");
      } catch {}
      $<HTMLElement>("[data-ff-copied]").textContent = " Kopyalandı.";
    });
    void pngWithMeta;
    void downloadBlob;

    logo.onload = () => draw();
    sizeCanvas();
    draw();
  }

  function paintSample(g: CanvasRenderingContext2D) {
    const W = 1920, H = 1080;
    const sky = g.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, H);
    sky.addColorStop(0, "#c98a54");
    sky.addColorStop(0.6, "#7b5a8f");
    sky.addColorStop(1, "#2c3a5c");
    g.fillStyle = sky;
    g.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);
    g.fillStyle = "rgba(20,18,30,.55)";
    g.beginPath();
    g.moveTo(0, 820);
    for (let x = 0; x <= W; x += 80) g.lineTo(x, 760 + Math.sin(x / 170) * 50);
    g.lineTo(W, H);
    g.lineTo(0, H);
    g.fill();
    const person = (x: number, s: number, c: string) => {
      g.fillStyle = c;
      g.beginPath();
      g.arc(x, 430 * s + (1 - s) * 400, 70 * s, 0, Math.PI * 2);
      g.fill();
      g.beginPath();
      g.roundRect(x - 120 * s, 520 * s + (1 - s) * 400, 240 * s, 560 * s, 90 * s);
      g.fill();
    };
    person(640, 1, "rgba(255,240,225,.9)");
    person(1340, 0.92, "rgba(255,240,225,.75)");
    g.fillStyle = "rgba(255,255,255,.95)";
    g.font = "700 64px system-ui, sans-serif";
    g.fillText("Örnek 16:9 kare", 70, 120);
    g.font = "500 34px system-ui, sans-serif";
    g.fillText("Kendi görselinizi ya da videonuzu açın", 70, 172);
    g.font = "600 30px system-ui, sans-serif";
    g.fillText("Konuk A", 585, 1000);
    g.fillText("Konuk B", 1285, 1000);
  }
</script>
